WEBVTT

00:00:49.444 --> 00:00:54.074
DEAR X

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:56.994
ALL CHARACTERS, PLACES, AND EVENTS
IN THIS WORK ARE FICTITIOUS

00:00:57.077 --> 00:00:58.620
CHILD ACTORS WERE FILMED
WITH GUARDIANS PRESENT

00:01:01.623 --> 00:01:04.084
EPISODE 9: NEW HEIGHTS

00:01:04.418 --> 00:01:07.880
Longstar Entertainment released
an official statement today

00:01:07.963 --> 00:01:09.298
announcing that it has terminated

00:01:09.381 --> 00:01:11.300
its exclusive contract
with actress Baek Ah-jin

00:01:11.383 --> 00:01:13.218
effectively ousting her
from the agency.

00:01:13.302 --> 00:01:14.553
According to Longstar

00:01:14.636 --> 00:01:18.140
the decision was made
after determining that the trust

00:01:18.223 --> 00:01:20.976
between the two parties
could no longer be restored.

00:01:21.059 --> 00:01:24.313
Some speculate that
this may effectively put a halt

00:01:24.396 --> 00:01:27.441
to Baek Ah-jin's acting career.

00:01:27.524 --> 00:01:31.486
Baek Ah-jin has not issued
any public statement

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:33.780
and attention now turns to
her next move.

00:01:37.451 --> 00:01:38.952
Think about it, Mr. Cha.

00:01:39.036 --> 00:01:42.039
Why pick up an actress
I've already used and tossed aside?

00:01:43.332 --> 00:01:46.835
Your company just went public,
so you might want to be more careful.

00:01:47.836 --> 00:01:49.421
You must have read the articles.

00:01:52.841 --> 00:01:55.052
Why do you think I cut her loose?

00:01:56.803 --> 00:01:58.847
Something big is about to blow up.

00:01:59.306 --> 00:02:02.935
So don't even think about
waving a contract at Baek Ah-jin.

00:02:03.644 --> 00:02:05.562
Just focus on the people
you already have.

00:02:06.313 --> 00:02:09.358
This isn't friendly advice.
It's a warning.

00:02:19.701 --> 00:02:20.744
You're early.

00:02:24.373 --> 00:02:25.707
What's with that look?

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.627
Do you want to shove me
off this rooftop?

00:02:29.169 --> 00:02:30.963
Did you have to take it this far?

00:02:32.297 --> 00:02:34.132
Isn't it nice and cool up here?

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:38.929
Figured a little cold breeze
might slap some sense back into you.

00:02:39.638 --> 00:02:40.639
So?

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:43.267
Is reality sinking in?

00:02:44.059 --> 00:02:45.727
I just don't get it.

00:02:47.396 --> 00:02:50.107
All this for In-gang?

00:02:50.732 --> 00:02:51.942
I've thought about it.

00:02:52.693 --> 00:02:55.112
About where it all went wrong.

00:02:57.114 --> 00:02:59.866
If I hadn't reached out to you
in the first place...

00:03:00.867 --> 00:03:03.370
If you and In-gang had never met...

00:03:06.623 --> 00:03:08.959
Would he still be alive?

00:03:09.042 --> 00:03:11.211
When I told you I was dating him

00:03:12.379 --> 00:03:14.047
you knew what could come of it.

00:03:16.008 --> 00:03:17.676
But you turned a blind eye

00:03:17.759 --> 00:03:19.970
because the agency
was cashing in on us.

00:03:21.138 --> 00:03:22.389
That was you.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:24.933
So why am I doing this now?

00:03:25.559 --> 00:03:26.768
I'm not sure.

00:03:28.687 --> 00:03:31.106
I'm trying to figure out
how to wash away this guilt

00:03:31.189 --> 00:03:32.774
I have about In-gang.

00:03:32.858 --> 00:03:34.735
And the more I think about it...

00:03:37.612 --> 00:03:40.324
the answer
keeps circling back to you.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.953
What are you planning to do?

00:03:46.038 --> 00:03:48.290
I'll have to undo the knot
I tied myself.

00:03:49.583 --> 00:03:50.876
And that means

00:03:52.169 --> 00:03:56.840
sending you back
to the life you came from.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:03:59.885
Just wait.

00:04:02.637 --> 00:04:06.683
I'm going to tear your life apart.

00:04:14.274 --> 00:04:15.776
I'm not letting you walk away.

00:04:18.111 --> 00:04:21.448
I'll put you right back in the gutter
you crawled out of.

00:04:23.116 --> 00:04:24.951
The suspect in her father's murder

00:04:26.328 --> 00:04:27.412
Baek Ah-jin.

00:04:32.542 --> 00:04:33.543
Go on.

00:04:35.003 --> 00:04:36.004
Hit me.

00:04:37.005 --> 00:04:39.800
If that's what it takes for you
to let it all out, I'll take it.

00:04:42.594 --> 00:04:44.763
Is that going to bring In-gang back?

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:49.643
Then what?
You want me to get down on my knees?

00:04:49.893 --> 00:04:51.686
Will that bring him back?

00:04:52.187 --> 00:04:54.439
Then what do you want me to do?

00:04:56.066 --> 00:04:58.527
If you jump off this building

00:04:59.653 --> 00:05:00.904
I'll call it even.

00:05:08.703 --> 00:05:09.788
That's funny.

00:05:11.415 --> 00:05:12.416
"Funny"?

00:05:16.336 --> 00:05:17.504
Ms. Seo.

00:05:20.215 --> 00:05:22.259
Am I the only one at fault here?

00:05:24.094 --> 00:05:25.887
Do you honestly believe that?

00:05:29.891 --> 00:05:32.644
You stayed by his side
for all those years

00:05:32.727 --> 00:05:35.897
and you still didn't see it coming?

00:05:36.648 --> 00:05:38.900
You knew he was falling apart

00:05:39.818 --> 00:05:41.736
for a long time.

00:05:43.822 --> 00:05:45.824
But you chose to look the other way

00:05:46.867 --> 00:05:48.201
because of your greed.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:52.831
And now you're throwing
the blame on me.

00:05:53.957 --> 00:05:55.876
So this is who you really are.

00:05:56.918 --> 00:05:58.253
You blame others--

00:05:58.336 --> 00:05:59.421
What do you know?

00:05:59.504 --> 00:06:01.131
I know this much.

00:06:03.467 --> 00:06:05.385
The one year he spent with me

00:06:06.094 --> 00:06:07.929
meant more to him

00:06:08.638 --> 00:06:11.475
than the ten years he spent with you.

00:06:41.796 --> 00:06:46.510
Just wait.
I'm going to tear your life apart.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.139
Damn it!

00:06:54.184 --> 00:06:55.268
Shit.

00:06:57.103 --> 00:06:58.188
Who says you get to?

00:07:00.315 --> 00:07:02.776
Don't get in my way
because I'm not going to stop.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:04.361
Ever.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.801
If your company can't take
any follow-up action regarding Ah-jin

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.887
I don't see any reason
to keep investing.

00:07:31.304 --> 00:07:33.056
We'll forgo the film investment.

00:07:33.765 --> 00:07:37.227
Are you saying you have no intention
of protecting Baek Ah-jin?

00:07:37.561 --> 00:07:39.563
Yes, that's correct.

00:07:42.315 --> 00:07:43.483
One last question.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:47.404
You're not planning to stop
at cutting her loose, are you?

00:07:47.904 --> 00:07:49.114
A word of advice?

00:07:49.739 --> 00:07:53.827
If you think there's anything human
left in Baek Ah-jin

00:07:54.995 --> 00:07:57.038
anything worth saving at all

00:07:58.415 --> 00:07:59.499
let it go.

00:08:00.041 --> 00:08:03.670
She'll drag everyone around her
straight to hell.

00:08:09.634 --> 00:08:12.470
Don't you think you're being
a little harsh with me?

00:08:12.554 --> 00:08:14.264
I just want to talk to him!

00:08:14.347 --> 00:08:17.017
The chairman instructed me
not to let you into the house.

00:08:17.517 --> 00:08:18.560
Please leave.

00:08:20.854 --> 00:08:22.856
Mr. Hong, I just need a word...

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:31.239
I feel so dizzy.

00:08:32.824 --> 00:08:33.825
I need a minute.

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:42.375
SON

00:09:04.397 --> 00:09:05.398
What now?

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:08.902
You still haven't told Jun-seo?

00:09:09.527 --> 00:09:11.613
I told you to let him know
that I got on my knees

00:09:11.696 --> 00:09:13.156
and apologized.

00:09:13.239 --> 00:09:14.616
Do you know how long it's been?

00:09:15.116 --> 00:09:16.117
Ms. Hwang.

00:09:16.493 --> 00:09:19.746
My head's already killing me,
so don't make it worse.

00:09:19.829 --> 00:09:22.415
If you want him to know that badly,
go tell him yourself.

00:09:23.249 --> 00:09:26.961
How am I supposed to tell him
if he won't pick up my calls?

00:09:27.045 --> 00:09:29.839
He won't even meet me
when I go to see him.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:34.177
What do you expect me to do?

00:09:34.552 --> 00:09:36.763
This level of attachment
isn't healthy.

00:09:36.846 --> 00:09:38.056
Learn when to stop.

00:09:38.348 --> 00:09:40.225
I'm not attached.

00:09:41.184 --> 00:09:42.352
I'm sick.

00:09:44.312 --> 00:09:45.647
I need surgery right away.

00:09:52.404 --> 00:09:54.989
Surgery? What kind of surgery?

00:09:57.158 --> 00:09:59.911
I'm on dialysis,
and I need a transplant.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:01.996
They say family members
usually donate.

00:10:02.956 --> 00:10:05.333
It could take years
to wait around for a donor.

00:10:05.417 --> 00:10:06.918
And it's not like I have options.

00:10:07.001 --> 00:10:09.796
I'm drowning in debt
and can't even afford the surgery.

00:10:10.213 --> 00:10:12.006
I don't have the money or the kidney.

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:14.050
At this rate, I'm going to die!

00:10:15.385 --> 00:10:18.930
Make sure Jun-seo hears that.

00:10:19.347 --> 00:10:24.477
So all this fuss is because
you need one of his kidneys, right?

00:10:25.603 --> 00:10:29.524
That's why you came to me
with that pathetic little apology.

00:10:29.899 --> 00:10:31.109
Well, perfect timing.

00:10:31.609 --> 00:10:35.405
He's standing right here,
so tell him yourself.

00:10:35.488 --> 00:10:37.907
Tell him you got on your knees
and apologized

00:10:37.991 --> 00:10:40.493
because you want his kidney.

00:10:43.037 --> 00:10:44.038
What?

00:10:45.623 --> 00:10:46.708
You heard her.

00:10:47.709 --> 00:10:49.377
Your mom needs a kidney.

00:10:51.004 --> 00:10:53.381
If you want to save her,
give her your kidney.

00:11:11.191 --> 00:11:12.358
Don't answer her calls.

00:11:13.151 --> 00:11:15.904
Who knows what she'll do if I don't?

00:11:16.654 --> 00:11:17.864
You know how she is.

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:21.159
Do you really not know

00:11:21.242 --> 00:11:25.205
or do you just pretend
because she's your mother?

00:11:27.332 --> 00:11:29.292
The same hands
that used to stroke your hair

00:11:29.375 --> 00:11:31.669
are the ones
that shoved my head underwater.

00:11:32.128 --> 00:11:33.213
Don't forget that.

00:11:38.802 --> 00:11:40.386
I met with Ms. Seo.

00:11:41.387 --> 00:11:43.890
She didn't budge an inch
when I said I'd pull my investment.

00:11:44.307 --> 00:11:46.518
Looks like she plans to go
all the way with you.

00:11:47.018 --> 00:11:50.855
She'll bury you
and make sure you never come back.

00:11:51.606 --> 00:11:52.690
I'm not surprised.

00:11:54.234 --> 00:11:56.528
She's so blinded by anger
that she can't see straight.

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:59.322
How far do you think she'll go?

00:11:59.405 --> 00:12:02.242
I honestly don't know.
She's never gone this far before.

00:12:20.718 --> 00:12:24.222
I talked to a few agencies,
but Ms. Seo already got to them.

00:12:24.722 --> 00:12:26.474
It won't be easy to get out of this.

00:12:27.058 --> 00:12:29.185
When has my life ever been easy?

00:12:29.269 --> 00:12:30.812
That's exactly what worries me.

00:12:32.021 --> 00:12:33.022
What do you mean?

00:12:33.273 --> 00:12:34.774
Every time you're cornered

00:12:34.858 --> 00:12:37.443
your solution is to cross
yet another line.

00:12:37.527 --> 00:12:39.529
I won't sit around like a fool.

00:12:42.907 --> 00:12:46.119
This is not the time to argue.
Focus on how we fix this.

00:12:47.996 --> 00:12:50.748
The shackle file.
Isn't that all we need?

00:12:52.083 --> 00:12:53.167
It's useless now.

00:12:58.882 --> 00:13:02.010
At this point,
either she dies or I do.

00:13:04.012 --> 00:13:05.179
One of us has to go.

00:13:32.999 --> 00:13:35.919
MEDICAL CENTER

00:13:40.173 --> 00:13:41.716
I'll give you my kidney.

00:13:41.799 --> 00:13:45.219
I'll pay off the loan sharks
and cover the surgery too.

00:13:46.846 --> 00:13:47.931
Really?

00:13:48.973 --> 00:13:50.850
But I have two conditions.

00:13:51.267 --> 00:13:54.270
First, you never show up
in front of Ah-jin again.

00:13:54.354 --> 00:13:58.024
Second, you stay away
from Grandpa for good.

00:13:58.566 --> 00:13:59.567
What?

00:13:59.651 --> 00:14:02.111
Once your debts are paid
and the surgery is covered

00:14:02.779 --> 00:14:05.740
you won't have any reason
to go to Grandpa for money.

00:14:05.823 --> 00:14:07.116
And once you have my kidney

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:09.786
you won't have to go
stirring things up with Ah-jin.

00:14:10.036 --> 00:14:12.455
From where I'm standing,
that seems fair.

00:14:16.918 --> 00:14:19.170
You make it sound like
I've got a contagious disease.

00:14:20.004 --> 00:14:21.798
Don't you think
you're being a little harsh?

00:14:22.423 --> 00:14:23.424
You don't like it?

00:14:24.968 --> 00:14:27.428
The people you keep hurting

00:14:27.762 --> 00:14:30.682
are the people I care about the most.

00:14:31.182 --> 00:14:32.850
So don't hurt Ah-jin or Grandpa

00:14:33.643 --> 00:14:34.811
ever again.

00:14:37.063 --> 00:14:38.481
Those are my conditions.

00:14:52.161 --> 00:14:53.413
What do you mean?

00:14:54.706 --> 00:14:55.957
Who's on the first floor?

00:14:57.375 --> 00:14:58.376
For what reason?

00:14:58.835 --> 00:14:59.836
Are you sure?

00:15:04.882 --> 00:15:05.925
What's going on?

00:15:06.009 --> 00:15:08.011
Ms. Seo, the police are in the lobby.

00:15:08.094 --> 00:15:10.179
The police? What do they want?

00:15:14.642 --> 00:15:15.643
Ms. Seo Mi-ri.

00:15:16.436 --> 00:15:21.024
We have a warrant for your arrest
and a warrant to search the premises.

00:15:21.774 --> 00:15:25.695
This morning, CEO Seo Mi-ri
of Longstar Entertainment

00:15:25.778 --> 00:15:27.739
was taken into police custody.

00:15:27.822 --> 00:15:29.240
Police say they uncovered evidence

00:15:29.323 --> 00:15:32.243
that she embezzled
several billion won in company funds.

00:15:32.326 --> 00:15:35.246
Investigators conducted
a five-hour search-and-seizure

00:15:35.329 --> 00:15:38.624
at the company's headquarters
as part of an expanding probe.

00:15:38.958 --> 00:15:41.294
Authorities say embezzlement
is only one part of the case.

00:15:41.377 --> 00:15:44.756
New claims accuse Seo of abusing
and threatening her artists

00:15:44.839 --> 00:15:48.259
fostering what insiders describe
as a climate of fear.

00:15:48.801 --> 00:15:50.803
She allegedly used
the so-called "shackle files"

00:15:50.887 --> 00:15:53.681
documents containing private details
about her artists

00:15:53.765 --> 00:15:55.933
to intimidate and control them.

00:15:56.017 --> 00:16:00.229
Police have seized these files
and will verify their authenticity.

00:16:00.313 --> 00:16:01.856
Is everything in the file true?

00:16:01.939 --> 00:16:03.775
When did you find out
about the shackle files?

00:16:03.858 --> 00:16:06.736
Additional charges
against CEO Seo Mi-ri have surfaced.

00:16:06.819 --> 00:16:08.613
Police say they uncovered evidence

00:16:08.696 --> 00:16:12.658
that she bribed broadcast officials
and entertainment reporters

00:16:12.742 --> 00:16:15.453
in an effort to promote
her agency's artists.

00:16:15.536 --> 00:16:18.039
Police have added breach-of-trust
and bribery charges

00:16:18.122 --> 00:16:19.749
and are seeking a detention warrant.

00:16:27.006 --> 00:16:28.007
Yes, Mr. Hong.

00:16:30.551 --> 00:16:32.053
I'm going into surgery soon

00:16:32.136 --> 00:16:34.514
so I won't be able
to visit Grandpa for a while.

00:16:37.433 --> 00:16:40.269
Please don't tell him
about the kidney transplant.

00:16:42.396 --> 00:16:44.398
Yes. Look after him.

00:16:45.108 --> 00:16:46.484
I'll contact you again.

00:17:03.835 --> 00:17:05.253
What was that about?

00:17:07.046 --> 00:17:08.214
A kidney transplant?

00:17:13.136 --> 00:17:15.054
I'm giving my kidney to my mom.

00:17:15.138 --> 00:17:18.558
Are you serious?
How could you not tell me that?

00:17:18.641 --> 00:17:21.352
If I hadn't come today,
were you really not going to tell me?

00:17:22.603 --> 00:17:23.604
Lena.

00:17:24.105 --> 00:17:25.106
No wonder.

00:17:26.607 --> 00:17:30.486
Every time I asked you for a drink,
you kept making excuses.

00:17:31.612 --> 00:17:34.574
I thought you'd come around,
so I waited like an idiot.

00:17:35.283 --> 00:17:37.618
But did you even care
that I was waiting for your call?

00:17:38.202 --> 00:17:40.079
Do you like making me feel stupid?

00:17:40.163 --> 00:17:41.998
Am I that much of a joke to you?

00:17:45.209 --> 00:17:46.711
Careful, you'll hurt yourself.

00:17:48.045 --> 00:17:49.046
Stop.

00:17:58.723 --> 00:17:59.807
You're a jerk.

00:18:32.173 --> 00:18:33.591
Your surgery is today, right?

00:18:34.091 --> 00:18:35.092
Yes.

00:18:35.593 --> 00:18:37.511
Don't give me anything
to worry about.

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:39.931
I hate that.

00:18:40.473 --> 00:18:41.599
Okay.

00:18:41.682 --> 00:18:44.560
I'm relieved
that Seo Mi-ri has been arrested.

00:18:45.019 --> 00:18:47.021
One less thing for me
to worry about you.

00:18:48.898 --> 00:18:50.608
How can it be so easy for you?

00:18:51.359 --> 00:18:53.277
You're giving up
a part of yourself for someone else

00:18:53.361 --> 00:18:54.487
and it's no big deal?

00:18:55.529 --> 00:18:56.614
You can still smile?

00:18:56.697 --> 00:18:57.698
Ah-jin.

00:18:59.742 --> 00:19:01.285
You don't have to come
to the hospital.

00:19:02.328 --> 00:19:05.581
Just wait for me,
and I'll come to you.

00:19:07.208 --> 00:19:09.085
So don't worry about me.

00:19:10.711 --> 00:19:12.004
I should go now.

00:19:12.838 --> 00:19:14.423
Don't skip your meals, okay?

00:19:15.424 --> 00:19:16.425
I'll hang up.

00:19:52.962 --> 00:19:55.214
An exclusive management contract?

00:19:55.965 --> 00:19:58.259
My public image isn't
exactly great right now.

00:19:59.844 --> 00:20:02.263
Are you sure you made this offer
with that in mind?

00:20:02.346 --> 00:20:03.514
Absolutely.

00:20:04.056 --> 00:20:05.766
To be honest

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:08.352
we're not worried about that at all.

00:20:08.978 --> 00:20:13.149
We're investing in your future value.

00:20:13.566 --> 00:20:16.819
And any image reset can be managed
on our side without difficulty.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:20.323
Ms. Baek, if you're free now

00:20:20.406 --> 00:20:22.408
would you mind
stopping by our office?

00:20:23.242 --> 00:20:24.410
We can have a meeting first

00:20:24.493 --> 00:20:26.287
and take our time
discussing the contract.

00:20:45.348 --> 00:20:46.349
Where are you going?

00:20:48.768 --> 00:20:49.852
Aren't you going to eat?

00:20:50.269 --> 00:20:51.687
I ordered your food too.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:55.691
Hey!

00:20:58.319 --> 00:20:59.862
You eat it.

00:21:00.696 --> 00:21:04.575
And put that watch back where it was
before I call the cops.

00:21:05.159 --> 00:21:06.869
Seriously.

00:21:08.496 --> 00:21:09.580
Don't be so stingy.

00:21:10.581 --> 00:21:13.125
It's fine if I wear it at your place.

00:21:14.126 --> 00:21:16.462
Oh, right.
Most of your hate comments are gone.

00:21:16.545 --> 00:21:18.547
And the articles trashing you
got deleted too.

00:21:22.676 --> 00:21:23.677
Look.

00:21:24.595 --> 00:21:27.515
Everything got wiped clean.
I told you it would.

00:21:29.183 --> 00:21:31.352
Just a few days ago,
there were tons of them.

00:21:31.435 --> 00:21:32.728
Isn't that wild?

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:36.982
Do you spend all day
searching for my name online?

00:21:37.691 --> 00:21:39.068
You have nothing better to do?

00:21:41.987 --> 00:21:43.489
You really don't get it.

00:21:43.572 --> 00:21:45.950
Keeping tabs on you
is part of my daily routine.

00:21:46.033 --> 00:21:47.326
When an article about you drops

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:50.663
leaving the first hate comment
is my little hobby.

00:21:54.375 --> 00:21:56.502
Hey, grab some snacks
on your way back.

00:21:57.128 --> 00:21:58.129
Something sweet.

00:21:58.921 --> 00:22:00.172
It must be nice.

00:22:00.256 --> 00:22:02.425
Your life just works out
even when you don't try.

00:22:02.508 --> 00:22:03.509
Must be nice for you too.

00:22:03.592 --> 00:22:07.096
Every time things get rough,
someone swoops in to save you.

00:22:10.307 --> 00:22:12.226
Are you dumb, or just immature?

00:22:13.602 --> 00:22:16.355
A life where someone has to show up
and save you every time

00:22:16.439 --> 00:22:17.940
actually looks good to you?

00:22:19.525 --> 00:22:21.277
If you like it so much, you take it.

00:22:22.611 --> 00:22:24.572
Not that you're on that level.

00:22:26.323 --> 00:22:27.324
Hey!

00:22:29.285 --> 00:22:30.870
What a brat.

00:22:32.830 --> 00:22:35.666
I'm here to show you this luxury bag.

00:22:36.876 --> 00:22:39.128
What do you think?
Isn't my baby gorgeous?

00:22:39.879 --> 00:22:42.256
It's been so long.

00:22:42.339 --> 00:22:44.049
It was about ten million won--

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:47.094
IT WAS ABOUT TEN MILLION WON
WHEN I BOUGHT IT

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:07.239
This is ten million won?

00:23:09.116 --> 00:23:12.077
Even used, this must be worth
at least a few million won.

00:23:15.331 --> 00:23:17.583
This is insane!

00:23:22.254 --> 00:23:23.631
Welcome.

00:24:04.213 --> 00:24:07.675
What took you so long?
The store is right around the corner.

00:24:16.141 --> 00:24:17.142
Hey.

00:24:17.893 --> 00:24:19.812
Did you forget
to microwave the kimchi?

00:24:21.188 --> 00:24:22.690
Just eat it.

00:24:22.773 --> 00:24:25.234
It all turns warm
the second it hits your stomach.

00:24:33.951 --> 00:24:34.952
You're not eating?

00:24:36.620 --> 00:24:39.999
You can have it all.
I don't have an appetite.

00:24:45.921 --> 00:24:46.922
By the way

00:24:47.631 --> 00:24:50.718
about the black sedan I mentioned,
did you find anything?

00:24:50.801 --> 00:24:52.094
I gave you the plate number.

00:24:52.177 --> 00:24:55.723
Oh, that car?
Turns out it's a ghost car.

00:24:55.806 --> 00:24:57.099
Fake plates and everything.

00:25:01.395 --> 00:25:02.605
These guys are pros.

00:25:03.772 --> 00:25:07.359
If those guys beat you up like that,
they must be dangerous.

00:25:07.443 --> 00:25:10.070
Didn't you say
they were tailing your girl?

00:25:10.154 --> 00:25:11.572
You should warn her about them.

00:25:14.074 --> 00:25:15.075
You're right.

00:25:15.909 --> 00:25:18.579
Stressing over it alone
isn't going to solve anything.

00:25:20.664 --> 00:25:23.459
I should give her a heads-up
and tell her to be careful, right?

00:25:24.126 --> 00:25:29.381
What does your girlfriend do
that guys like that are after her?

00:25:29.965 --> 00:25:32.843
It's none of your business,
so stop prying.

00:25:35.763 --> 00:25:36.764
Hello?

00:25:40.517 --> 00:25:42.227
Where are you? I'll come to you.

00:25:43.187 --> 00:25:44.521
I'm stepping out for a bit.

00:25:45.105 --> 00:25:46.190
Where are you going?

00:25:53.572 --> 00:25:56.909
Sir, it's time to move
to the lecture hall.

00:26:12.299 --> 00:26:16.178
I almost got into a bad accident
driving alone last time.

00:26:17.096 --> 00:26:19.348
I've been scared to drive ever since.

00:26:21.850 --> 00:26:23.519
You're lucky you didn't get hurt.

00:26:24.395 --> 00:26:27.606
If you feel uncomfortable driving,
just reach out to me.

00:26:28.857 --> 00:26:30.901
Jun-seo specifically told me

00:26:30.984 --> 00:26:33.445
to stick close to you
while he's away.

00:26:33.779 --> 00:26:37.700
Also, don't drive so close to people
who drive like maniacs.

00:26:37.783 --> 00:26:39.618
You could get dragged
into their accident.

00:26:41.954 --> 00:26:43.789
I was that maniac driver.

00:26:44.289 --> 00:26:46.250
I was the one
who almost caused an accident.

00:26:50.671 --> 00:26:51.672
Yeah?

00:26:57.219 --> 00:27:01.140
Do you still have
that burner phone I gave you?

00:27:02.391 --> 00:27:03.392
Why?

00:27:05.644 --> 00:27:08.981
You know how dangerous
the world can be.

00:27:09.273 --> 00:27:10.941
So keep it on you at all times.

00:27:11.024 --> 00:27:13.736
If anything happens,
call me right away.

00:27:14.570 --> 00:27:16.947
You're so lame, Jae-oh.

00:27:20.200 --> 00:27:21.410
So where are we going?

00:27:21.952 --> 00:27:25.456
An agency meeting.
They asked me to come by the office.

00:27:26.749 --> 00:27:28.959
If everything checks out,
I might sign today.

00:27:29.251 --> 00:27:30.711
I knew it.

00:27:30.794 --> 00:27:34.089
Longstar goes down, and everything
starts working out for you again.

00:27:42.306 --> 00:27:44.308
Here at DO Entertainment

00:27:44.391 --> 00:27:47.436
we're a full-service agency
active across multiple fields

00:27:47.519 --> 00:27:50.022
including drama, films,
and broadcast content.

00:27:50.105 --> 00:27:53.066
We're also rapidly expanding
into online content

00:27:53.150 --> 00:27:55.319
and our label business
is growing aggressively.

00:27:55.402 --> 00:27:58.739
We'll provide
comprehensive management support

00:27:59.114 --> 00:28:01.158
so you can work across
a wide range of projects.

00:28:01.784 --> 00:28:03.786
And as you can see there

00:28:03.869 --> 00:28:07.372
the revenue split is
structured to be beneficial for you.

00:28:11.210 --> 00:28:12.211
By the way

00:28:13.545 --> 00:28:16.715
what kind of relationship do you have
with Mr. Moon Do-hyuk?

00:28:17.716 --> 00:28:19.301
Mr. Moon Do-hyuk?

00:28:20.803 --> 00:28:24.389
The person who pushed
the hardest for us to sign you

00:28:24.473 --> 00:28:26.517
was actually Mr. Moon Do-hyuk,
CEO of Hadere.

00:28:26.600 --> 00:28:28.310
He's a major shareholder
in our company.

00:28:28.852 --> 00:28:31.980
And he's got a real eye for talent.

00:28:32.856 --> 00:28:34.775
I heard he personally cleaned up

00:28:34.858 --> 00:28:38.403
all the smear pieces about you
ahead of time.

00:28:39.112 --> 00:28:43.116
So I assumed you knew him personally.

00:28:55.128 --> 00:28:56.713
SATURN'S PHILOSOPHY AND VISION

00:29:14.314 --> 00:29:16.650
Sir, I have a question.

00:29:17.484 --> 00:29:19.945
- Yes?
- After meeting you today

00:29:20.028 --> 00:29:22.197
I found you impressive
not only as a businessman

00:29:22.281 --> 00:29:25.617
but as someone
who's truly worthy of respect.

00:29:49.349 --> 00:29:50.350
Thank you.

00:29:50.767 --> 00:29:52.144
- Thank you.
- Thank you for your time.

00:29:52.227 --> 00:29:54.354
He's amazing, isn't he?

00:29:54.730 --> 00:29:56.398
Thank you for coming.

00:29:58.567 --> 00:29:59.568
Thank you.

00:30:15.292 --> 00:30:16.543
It's nice to meet you.

00:30:18.170 --> 00:30:19.171
I'm Baek Ah-jin.

00:30:22.633 --> 00:30:23.634
I'm Moon Do-hyuk.

00:30:25.802 --> 00:30:28.931
It's our first time meeting,
but we're not exactly strangers.

00:30:29.306 --> 00:30:30.933
You seem to know me pretty well.

00:30:31.767 --> 00:30:33.602
I do. I've been waiting.

00:30:35.562 --> 00:30:37.731
I honestly thought
we'd meet a little sooner.

00:30:39.024 --> 00:30:40.943
I wanted to thank you.

00:30:41.735 --> 00:30:43.320
You believed in me

00:30:43.403 --> 00:30:44.988
when everyone else
turned their backs.

00:30:47.282 --> 00:30:50.577
I always believe in myself
and in my own judgment.

00:30:50.661 --> 00:30:54.081
I'd like to know
why you're helping me.

00:30:55.916 --> 00:30:56.917
Shall we sit?

00:31:10.347 --> 00:31:11.932
The company I run donates

00:31:12.015 --> 00:31:15.227
over 15 percent of its annual revenue
to charity every year.

00:31:15.727 --> 00:31:19.147
That money goes
to the underprivileged.

00:31:20.941 --> 00:31:22.859
I like helping the unfortunate.

00:31:23.902 --> 00:31:26.488
I really can't stand
just watching them struggle.

00:31:27.906 --> 00:31:30.993
In that sense, I've been watching you
fighting to survive

00:31:31.326 --> 00:31:33.078
for quite some time now.

00:31:33.745 --> 00:31:38.083
"What would have become of you
if you had grown up

00:31:38.166 --> 00:31:40.836
in a normal family
with parental support?"

00:31:42.129 --> 00:31:43.797
It started from that simple question.

00:31:43.880 --> 00:31:46.675
And that's what made me
want to become your guardian.

00:31:47.843 --> 00:31:50.512
Sounds like you've done
a lot of digging.

00:31:51.388 --> 00:31:52.764
I can't stand being curious.

00:31:53.890 --> 00:31:54.975
That's interesting.

00:31:55.934 --> 00:31:58.020
I never thought my miserable life

00:31:59.187 --> 00:32:01.106
would captivate anyone.

00:32:01.940 --> 00:32:07.279
The moments you shone brightest
were when you were acting.

00:32:07.362 --> 00:32:09.156
I didn't want it to end like this.

00:32:09.698 --> 00:32:12.617
It looked like you were in a crisis,
so I simply held out my hand.

00:32:12.993 --> 00:32:14.369
Like I said

00:32:14.453 --> 00:32:17.622
I get a sense of purpose
from helping talented people

00:32:17.706 --> 00:32:18.915
with real potential.

00:32:19.916 --> 00:32:22.627
It seems removing Ms. Seo
from the picture isn't

00:32:22.711 --> 00:32:24.546
the end of your plan.

00:32:27.758 --> 00:32:30.052
What kind of plan do you have for me?

00:32:33.555 --> 00:32:34.848
I can't tell you that yet.

00:32:35.682 --> 00:32:36.892
It's a surprise.

00:32:37.434 --> 00:32:40.228
If you drag out the preview,
it ruins the fun.

00:32:42.022 --> 00:32:43.690
I have another appointment today.

00:32:44.900 --> 00:32:47.277
Why don't we set a proper time
to meet next time?

00:32:52.324 --> 00:32:53.658
I'll call you.

00:33:10.258 --> 00:33:12.969
- Hey.
- Hey, when are you being discharged?

00:33:13.845 --> 00:33:14.846
Was it next week?

00:33:15.305 --> 00:33:16.807
No, I'm heading out today.

00:33:16.890 --> 00:33:18.725
My recovery was fast,
so they moved it up two days.

00:33:18.809 --> 00:33:20.018
Oh, really?

00:33:20.727 --> 00:33:22.062
That's perfect.

00:33:22.145 --> 00:33:24.731
Can you swing by the office
after you get out?

00:33:25.190 --> 00:33:27.275
There's a pressing matter
we need to talk about.

00:33:27.984 --> 00:33:30.028
Can't we just do it over the phone?

00:33:30.112 --> 00:33:31.196
Come on, man.

00:33:31.279 --> 00:33:32.364
Seriously?

00:33:32.447 --> 00:33:36.243
Didn't you hear me say
it was a pressing matter?

00:33:36.660 --> 00:33:38.495
I'd come to where you are

00:33:38.578 --> 00:33:40.997
but my boss isn't in
because it's the weekend.

00:33:41.081 --> 00:33:42.082
So if you could...

00:33:43.792 --> 00:33:46.962
Forget it.
You're a patient, after all.

00:33:47.796 --> 00:33:49.840
I'll come to you.
You craving anything?

00:33:50.674 --> 00:33:53.718
No, I'll just stop by the office
this evening.

00:33:57.931 --> 00:33:58.932
What?

00:34:19.953 --> 00:34:21.538
NAME: HWANG JI-SUN

00:34:51.318 --> 00:34:53.945
These are Seo Mi-ri's shackle files
that the police obtained.

00:34:54.571 --> 00:34:57.157
If we delete Ms. Baek's portion
and send it back

00:34:57.240 --> 00:34:58.575
this should wrap up quietly.

00:35:00.452 --> 00:35:01.620
And the reporter?

00:35:01.703 --> 00:35:04.289
We checked all of his files.
Came up clean.

00:35:07.584 --> 00:35:09.669
That leaves two loose ends.

00:35:14.925 --> 00:35:17.385
Leave the one who just had surgery
alone for now.

00:35:17.469 --> 00:35:18.470
Yes, sir.

00:35:19.512 --> 00:35:20.847
As for this guy...

00:35:23.391 --> 00:35:24.893
I've grown a bit attached.

00:35:24.976 --> 00:35:27.229
I'd rather this one go quietly,
without any noise.

00:35:27.938 --> 00:35:29.981
How should we handle it?

00:35:38.281 --> 00:35:39.699
Since it's cold out...

00:35:41.910 --> 00:35:42.994
let's keep him warm.

00:35:49.876 --> 00:35:53.672
They said the police have issued
a detention warrant.

00:35:54.756 --> 00:35:56.675
Why are they in such a hurry?

00:35:57.133 --> 00:35:58.301
Something's not right.

00:35:59.427 --> 00:36:00.887
Did you talk to your lawyer?

00:36:01.596 --> 00:36:03.223
What is he advising you to do?

00:36:04.516 --> 00:36:06.893
He said when the police
push this hard

00:36:06.977 --> 00:36:10.063
it usually means
they already have solid evidence.

00:36:10.146 --> 00:36:12.565
His advice is to admit to it
and try for a reduced sentence.

00:36:13.149 --> 00:36:14.859
He said probation is unlikely.

00:36:15.735 --> 00:36:18.363
- What do we do?
- Someone's behind this.

00:36:18.780 --> 00:36:21.908
Otherwise, how would
everything line up so neatly?

00:36:22.450 --> 00:36:24.619
And the person behind
whoever's pulling the strings

00:36:24.703 --> 00:36:26.121
must be Ah-jin.

00:36:31.376 --> 00:36:32.877
Ah-jin!

00:36:33.420 --> 00:36:34.421
Ah-jin.

00:36:35.130 --> 00:36:37.465
I need to talk to you.

00:36:39.050 --> 00:36:40.051
What's this about?

00:36:41.136 --> 00:36:44.014
Ah-jin, let Longstar off the hook.

00:36:45.056 --> 00:36:47.267
Why are you asking me
to save your company?

00:36:47.517 --> 00:36:49.019
What does it have to do with me?

00:36:49.269 --> 00:36:50.854
You've come to the wrong person.

00:36:51.313 --> 00:36:55.483
Ms. Seo regrets what she did to you.

00:36:55.567 --> 00:36:57.527
If you help her this once

00:36:58.028 --> 00:37:00.238
she says she'll let
bygones be bygones.

00:37:01.323 --> 00:37:03.283
- Please, Ah-jin.
- Ms. Moon.

00:37:05.160 --> 00:37:08.038
What makes you think
I could pull something like this off?

00:37:08.955 --> 00:37:12.042
She was the one who was after me,
not the other way around.

00:37:16.671 --> 00:37:17.714
Ah-jin.

00:37:20.925 --> 00:37:22.469
We're really sorry.

00:37:24.637 --> 00:37:25.638
Please.

00:37:25.722 --> 00:37:28.558
Perhaps she sent you
to get on your knees and beg.

00:37:28.808 --> 00:37:31.644
Funny thing is,
I tried to beg her for help too.

00:37:32.270 --> 00:37:33.563
But she wouldn't hear me out.

00:37:34.773 --> 00:37:38.860
She just told me
to throw myself off the roof.

00:37:43.448 --> 00:37:45.992
The shackle files
are already with the police.

00:37:47.452 --> 00:37:49.329
So if there's no way out

00:37:50.288 --> 00:37:52.415
she should take her own advice
and kill herself.

00:38:09.682 --> 00:38:11.893
ARTIST: BAEK AH-JIN
AGENCY: DO ENTERTAINMENT

00:39:24.507 --> 00:39:26.217
Should we keep going
or should we stop?

00:39:27.177 --> 00:39:28.344
You decide.

00:39:32.807 --> 00:39:35.810
You really know everything,
don't you?

00:39:38.188 --> 00:39:41.649
How could I not?
I'm the one who set it all in motion.

00:39:42.942 --> 00:39:45.612
It's all thanks to you.
I appreciate it.

00:39:48.364 --> 00:39:50.909
So? How does it feel?

00:39:52.577 --> 00:39:54.245
Is that good enough for you?

00:39:55.330 --> 00:39:56.331
What did you want to discuss?

00:40:08.301 --> 00:40:09.594
You see these marks?

00:40:09.677 --> 00:40:11.513
What happened to you?

00:40:15.099 --> 00:40:18.186
The other day
I saw some shady guys tailing Ah-jin.

00:40:18.436 --> 00:40:22.357
I followed them,
and they beat the crap out of me.

00:40:22.982 --> 00:40:23.983
What?

00:40:24.359 --> 00:40:28.696
They had several cars on her.
They weren't messing around.

00:40:29.364 --> 00:40:32.450
But they're all ghost cars.
I couldn't even trace the plates.

00:40:34.827 --> 00:40:37.497
They're the ones
who gave you a hard time.

00:40:37.580 --> 00:40:39.541
If you want, I can do worse.

00:40:39.791 --> 00:40:43.628
I can send them far away
so they never come near you.

00:40:44.087 --> 00:40:47.757
Or I can destroy them
so they never cross your mind again.

00:40:54.138 --> 00:40:56.599
I don't get it, though.

00:41:00.353 --> 00:41:01.521
What don't you get?

00:41:01.854 --> 00:41:05.024
Why you're going this far for me.

00:41:08.361 --> 00:41:10.488
Are you into me?

00:41:22.083 --> 00:41:23.376
Does Ah-jin know about this?

00:41:25.628 --> 00:41:27.922
I was going to tell her
once I knew what was happening.

00:41:30.967 --> 00:41:32.260
You've lived a rough life.

00:41:33.094 --> 00:41:36.681
And like I told you,
I can't ignore people like that.

00:41:37.181 --> 00:41:40.393
Ms. Baek, I know
how hard your life has been.

00:41:41.644 --> 00:41:46.482
You must have cried a lot as a kid.
Am I right?

00:41:47.775 --> 00:41:49.444
How much do you know?

00:41:49.527 --> 00:41:51.029
How high do you want to go?

00:42:04.125 --> 00:42:06.044
I wanted to discuss it
with you first.

00:42:15.219 --> 00:42:16.220
Hey.

00:42:22.060 --> 00:42:23.728
Do you smell that?

00:42:24.103 --> 00:42:28.149
I'll help you achieve
anything you want.

00:42:31.277 --> 00:42:32.570
So tell me

00:42:34.447 --> 00:42:35.907
how high you want to go.

00:42:54.342 --> 00:42:57.929
I'm offering you this opportunity,
so think carefully.

00:42:59.472 --> 00:43:03.518
Think hard about what choice
you need to make right now.

00:43:11.442 --> 00:43:13.069
It's not that complicated.

00:43:13.778 --> 00:43:16.364
You'll star in
Director Park's new film

00:43:16.989 --> 00:43:18.908
make your international debut

00:43:19.158 --> 00:43:21.994
and take home Best Actress
at a major festival.

00:43:22.245 --> 00:43:25.206
You'll spend your days
as a brilliant actress.

00:43:25.289 --> 00:43:29.919
And you'll enjoy all of that
as my wife.

00:43:35.883 --> 00:43:36.884
Hey.

00:43:36.968 --> 00:43:38.010
Shit.

00:43:41.264 --> 00:43:42.515
You okay?

00:43:51.899 --> 00:43:52.942
So?

00:43:53.401 --> 00:43:54.610
Do you like...

00:43:56.612 --> 00:43:57.822
my wedding gift?

00:44:02.493 --> 00:44:03.578
Wedding, you say?

00:44:08.332 --> 00:44:09.417
Move!

00:44:18.176 --> 00:44:22.513
I'll wipe away
all the stains from your past.

00:44:22.889 --> 00:44:25.933
And you'll start over by my side.

00:44:26.726 --> 00:44:28.519
I promise you, Ah-jin.

